00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:58,820
I'm going to kill you.

281
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:02,820
Hey, you're pretty good for a human. Who are you exactly?

282
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:18,000
You guys okay?

283
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:31,180
Chinoa? Fine. Yuichiro and Kamizuki should take points since they're the strongest one-on-one fighters. The rest of us will cover them and tag in if things start to look rough. We can't underestimate this guy's abilities.

284
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:43,360
This is bad. Things just took a turn for the worse.

285
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:45,540
What now? Do we retreat?

286
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:59,000
Getting out of here would be the best idea, but I doubt these three will let us do that. So we fight in full power. We let the demons almost completely possess us. But that still might not be enough.

287
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:04,600
Yes. We might not survive. But we are soldiers. We knew that from the start.

288
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:15,940
Okay, fine. If that's how it's going to be, just know that I'm not going to let any of you die. That's the whole reason I fought for so much power. Right, Ashramaru?

289
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:23,940
Um, Lord Crowley? What are you doing wasting your time with these humans? The seventh progenitor is waiting for you at the front line.

290
00:19:23,940 --> 00:19:34,040
Hmm? Ferret wants to see me. I probably shouldn't keep him waiting. Pity. Things were just starting to get interesting here.

291
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:45,660
Very well. I suppose this can wait until later. I'll let all of you go for today. But next time we meet, I'm draining every last drop of your blood.

292
00:19:46,260 --> 00:19:46,820
What?

293
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:52,560
So long for now, my cute little blood bag.

294
00:19:52,560 --> 00:20:07,520
We're okay. We don't have to fight.

295
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:15,920
That arrogant jerk. What a bastard. Treating us as if we were his playthings.

296
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:22,800
Pull yourself together. We need to get out of here before they start having second thoughts. Let's meet up with the Shinjuku units.

297
00:20:23,940 --> 00:20:29,320
Damn it! This is all wrong. I've got a cursed gear. I'm supposed to be as strong as he is.

298
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:37,120
Well, since you've got the Black Demon series, you could always learn some curses. That'd help get you closer to his power level.

299
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,160
Then why haven't you taught me any?

300
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:44,060
Well, I could. But what good is it if you're the only one who can defeat a powerful vampire?

301
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:47,060
I'd probably be killed while you fought.

302
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:48,020
Yoichi.

303
00:20:48,700 --> 00:20:49,180
Mitsuba.

304
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,960
They'd just end up dying, too.

305
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:54,040
That's why we have to work together.

306
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:57,900
All of us have to keep training so that we fight as a unit of equals.

307
00:20:57,900 --> 00:21:05,000
We're improving. I was happy to hear you ask about retreating. And there's something else I have to say.

308
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:13,860
Thank you for saving my life earlier, Yu. It's like Lieutenant Colonel Gurren said. You care about your friends.

309
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,260
Huh? Oh, it was nothing.

310
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:28,800
You know, I'm kind of ready to go back to Shibuya.

311
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:34,340
I hear you. But right now it's not an option. If Shinjuku falls, then Shibuya's next.

312
00:21:34,980 --> 00:21:37,580
Your sister's there. Remember that when we fight.

313
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,080
Let's get moving.

314
00:21:40,740 --> 00:21:42,120
We won't lose Shinjuku.

315
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:43,320
Right.

316
00:21:46,260 --> 00:22:16,240
Let's get moving.

317
00:22:16,260 --> 00:22:38,580
I need your blood, your real love tonight, our God's great light.

318
00:22:38,580 --> 00:23:08,560
I need your blood, your spirit, your love tonight, our God's great light.

319
00:23:08,580 --> 00:23:15,100
Yon gao shi ga kiunade toNaoたが

320
00:23:15,100 --> 00:23:22,580
Li gonna be talking about the storm

321
00:23:38,580 --> 00:23:39,580
fire attack.

